    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find My Frogs is a cozy hidden object game where you search for frogs and toads in a peaceful, hand-drawn village. Explore charming spots, uncover secrets, and help Uncle Froger gather everyone for a family photo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hand-drawn world of Moss Glade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find</strong> 350 Frogs and Toads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> 60+ hidden secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions \u2013 such as helping a little frog pick strawberries \u2013 Find My Frogs offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find My Frogs is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find My Frogs is a cozy hidden object game where you search for frogs and toads in a peaceful, hand-drawn village. Explore charming spots, uncover secrets, and help Uncle Froger gather everyone for a family photo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hand-drawn world of Moss Glade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find</strong> 350 Frogs and Toads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> 60+ hidden secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions \u2013 such as helping a little frog pick strawberries \u2013 Find My Frogs offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find My Frogs is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>",
